        "call": "Checker().check(nums, {result})",
        "checker": "class Checker:\n    def check(self, nums, result):\n        if not isinstance(result, list):\n            return False\n        n = len(nums)\n        expected = [i for i in range(1, n + 1) if i not in set(nums)]\n        return result == expected\n"
      }
